  m_text: '<color=#939612>Welcome to the Marble Blast Platinum Unity Port Online!

    This
    is the initial version (1.0) for the Marble Blast Platinum Unity Port Online.


    Press
    T to chat in-game which will disable all controls, press Enter to send the message
    and press Escape to cancel the message. In-game chat is disabled when watching
    a replay.


    For any concerns please message me at discord aspergergamer (NaCl586
    #8479)


    Enjoy your stay!

    - NaCl586</color>

'
